== Appearance ==
It has a blue and purple aliened aura to resemble the northern light phenomenon. When a player is killed by a knife with this effect, their dead body emits a glow in bright Aurora shines.

== Trivia ==

* This is the only item in the [[Australis & Borealis Bundle]] that cannot be purchased from a separate gamepass.
* This effect is very similar to [[Aurora (Effect)|Aurora]] visually and by name, however it is brighter and leaves a death effect on players.
* This is the first ever godly effect that was released on Christmas.
* This was the sixth godly effect introduced into the game, following [[Flow]], [[Darkswirl]], [[Flowerwood (Effect)|Flowerwood]], [[Glisten]], and [[Wraith (Effect)|Wraith]].
